meta {
  name: Accept Invitation
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/invitations/{{invitationToken}}/accept
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{accessToken}}
}

docs {
  # Accept Invitation

  Accept an invitation to join a trip.

  **Permission Required:** Authenticated user (must be logged in)

  **URL Parameters:**
  - `invitationToken`: The secure token from the invitation link

  **Notes:**
  - Requires authentication (user must be logged in)
  - Validates the token and checks expiration
  - Creates a new TripMember record with the specified role
  - Updates invitation status to "accepted"
  - Records the acceptance timestamp
  - Creates an activity log entry
  - Returns 404 if token is invalid
  - Returns 400 if invitation is expired or already used
}
